      "blocks": {
        "165039110956edf9a9-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is there a Minimum Order Quantity (MOQ)?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Currently, we do not have a minimum order quantity.  Rustic Strength's stance is everyone has<br/>to start somewhere.  We love helping the small business entrepreneurs get a foot hold in this business.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "165039110956edf9a9-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I get samples of the product before I purchase it?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Of course you can! We encourage you to get samples of the products you want to carry. In each product listing is a 4 oz sample. You may order as many samples as you need to at a very reasonable price. Additionally, when you first sign up for your Wholesale account, you will receive a discount code that is good for 1 of our Welcome Sample Packs (a $40 value). </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "165039110956edf9a9-2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why no pump or spout?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>This is about sustainability and decreasing waste in the environment. We do not automatically provide a pump or spout with our products because we are trying to reduce waste in the environment. <br/>• If you are refilling a eco-jug or gallon container you do not need an addition spigot. <br/>• You may already have a pump or spigot from your last order.If so, just keep this and reuse it when refilling containers.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "165039110956edf9a9-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Spouts and Pumps",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>All-in-one Spout</strong> - This \"Swiss Army Spout\" can do it all. </p><ul><li>Versatile Flow Control</li><li>Fast Flow for Large Containers</li><li>Slow Flow for Precision Filling</li><li>Rotates- Entire Spout Rotates in place to prevent dripping</li><li>360 degree Flow Control - Handle rotates 360 degrees for omnidirectional control</li><li>Should be used with our eco-jug dispenser only.<br/><br/><strong>Easy Flow Pump </strong>for eco-jug,<br/>buckets and drums<br/>• These pumps are used for any material<br/>• The tip can be moved up or down to control drips<br/>• They can have a reducer added onto the tip to pump into smaller opening containers</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "b8e3128e-8c91-4b3d-a2fa-8a0816455f93": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Retail Ready Items",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>12oz, 16oz, 64oz and 128oz containers that are ready on shelves as grab and go items. They can be used for a quick sale and returned to the shop for refill purposes. These are sold in packs and have material and labels on them.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "9d449c5c-dc3a-4bb5-95fa-06ba0f5cb172": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Bulk Containers",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>4 pack of 1 gallon, 5-gallon, 30-gallon drum and 55-gallon drum. These are used to refill existing containers of material you have on your shelf or containers brought in by customers.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "571aef3a-e384-4d2c-a792-0f09ee76bc0c": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Empty Containers for resell",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>We have 12oz, 16oz, 64oz, 128oz containers for you to resell to your customers. We will be adding glass, aluminum, stainless steel containers in varying sizes.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "20968c07-3e41-49e4-87b8-45ff3c181133": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "5 gallon fill weights in ounces",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Hand Soap -689</p><p>Dish Soap - 689</p><p>Laundry Detergent - 689</p><p>Shampoo - 684</p><p>Body Wash - 689</p><p>Conditioner - 640</p><p>Lotion - 640</p><p>Vinegar 100g - 680</p><p>Vinegar 200g - 684</p><p>Fabric Softener - 658.5</p><p>Lots of Purpose - 659</p><p>Rinse Aid - 661</p>",
