        "aeefcf08-1656-4467-8839-5e665686510e": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Glass container display option",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>This would be for items that customers purchase in small quantities, conditioner and lotion. The glass container is used as a display and when you reorder, you just refill your glass display from your refill bag.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "165039270565b4aa81-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Eco-Jug container display option",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p><strong> Horizontal position of eco-jug</strong><br/>This option takes up a floor space of 14. 5” length x 10” wide x 11.5” deep. The spigot would be in a downward facing position. Some dripping may occur.You will want to get small cups to place directly under the spigot, a drip pan on the floor to place under all the spigots, or some other upcycle technique.</p><p><strong>Vertical position of eco-jug </strong>This option takes up a floor space of 10” wide x 14.5 tall x 11.5” deep.  When fully extended the easy flow, pump takes up another 34” above the front of the container.  You do not need to fully extend the pump to get material out.  The pump pushes material out while the pump is moving up or down. The tip of the easy flow pump will turn upward to control drips.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "165039270565b4aa81-2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Bucket container",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>This option takes up a floor space of approximately 1 square foot (about 14” total).</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "165039270565b4aa81-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Drums or Barrels",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>30-gallon drum </strong>stands 29” and needs approximately 4 square feet of floor space. The easy flow pump takes up another 39” above the front of the drum. You do not need to fully extend the pump to get material out. While moving the pump up or down, the pump pushes material out. The tip of the easy flow pump will turn upward to control<br/>drips.</p><p><br/><strong>55-gallon drum</strong> stands 37” and needs approximately 4 square feet of floor space. The easy flow pump takes up another 36” above the 55-gallon. You do not need to fully extend the pump to get material out.While moving the pump up or down, the pump<br/>pushes material out. The tip of the easy flow pump will turn upward to control drips.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
